// NOTE: this file has no closing PHP tag ON PURPOSE (PSR-12): anything after such a tag, even a single
// newline, would be echoed to the browser and corrupt the JSON replies of api.php. (The tag cannot even
// be written inside these comments: PHP one-line comments END at a closing tag, echoing what follows!)
